{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20088","headline":"送别崔寅亮下第 · 孟郊","name":"送别崔寅亮下第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天地唯一气，用之自偏颇。\n忧人成苦吟，达士爲高歌。\n君子识不浅，桂枝忧更多。\n岁晏期攀折，时归且婆娑。\n素质如削玉，清词若倾河。\n虯龙未化时，鱼鳖同一波。\n去矣当自适，故乡饶薜萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}